# Pneumatic Heights' tube tunnels (CIPlay pneumatic_heights_caves, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe: the tubes' rock hw_mount at 57 2 (b 19, h 26, foot 5.72 m); kit_sys mouth 1 at 37 2 (yaw 90),
# mouth 2 at 37 -6; trunk east to 51 2 and south to 51 -4; the second mouth's tunnel 37 -6 -> 46 -6 -> 51 -4; the branch off
# the trunk at 47 2 north to the sorting room (47 5 -> 49 11, zone ph_tubes at 48 8). Floors ~5.72 (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (the knoll may move the land centre).
island Pneumatic Heights keep
offset 0 24
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and its two mouths from outside
picture ph_tubes_out 24 +3 2 37 +1.5 -2
picture ph_tubes_mouth2 28 +2.5 -12 37 +1.5 -6

# In by the second mouth: along its tunnel to the trunk's end, up the trunk, then the branch to the sorting room
# the bear in the sorting room (11-12 mixed monsters): alive on the dug floor, under the knoll's rock; then put down
wait 3
expect animals Bear 1
expect animalsinside Bear 1
kill Bear
expect animals Bear 0

walk 31 -6 to 37 -6 to 46 -6 to 51 -4 to 51 2 to 47 2 to 47 5 to 48 9
zone ph_tubes
picture ph_tubes_in 46 +2.5 4 49 +1 10 light=20

# Out by the first mouth
walk 48 9 to 47 5 to 47 2 to 37 2 to 31 2
